; Test percentage multiplication with bare number (no commodity)
; Covers amount.cc (propagate % commodity to result)
; A bare number times a percentage stays a percentage of the product:
; 100 * 19% is 1900% (that is, 19), the same as 19% * 100.

2024/01/01 Test
    Expenses:Food    (100 * 19%)
    Assets:Cash

test bal Expenses
               1900%  Expenses:Food
end test
